1
00:00:01,199 --> 00:00:02,193
Nibs: Tonight.

2
00:00:02,694 --> 00:00:05,480
Nibs: We get. The cookie.

3
00:00:14,080 --> 00:00:18,887
Bubbles: Blub-tastic! I'm here! Um, why am I here?

4
00:00:18,788 --> 00:00:20,403
Nibs: The mission, Bubbles!

5
00:00:20,303 --> 00:00:22,464
Bubbles: Ooooh, the mission!

6
00:00:22,765 --> 00:00:24,016
Bubbles: What mission?

7
00:00:28,016 --> 00:00:30,599
Nibs: Mochi! Wake up! Mission time!

8
00:00:31,199 --> 00:00:31,983
Mochi: Hm?

9
00:00:32,783 --> 00:00:34,003
Nibs: There's a cookie.

10
00:00:34,203 --> 00:00:35,201
Mochi: Snack?

11
00:00:39,801 --> 00:00:41,981
Nibs: Okay, team. Here's the plan.

12
00:00:41,981 --> 00:00:46,195
Nibs: The last honey oat cookie is in the jar, way up on the kitchen counter.

13
00:00:46,295 --> 00:00:54,253
Nibs: Step one, cross the slippery floor. Step two, sneak past the moonbeams. Step three, climb to the top!

14
00:00:54,353 --> 00:00:55,896
Bubbles: Can I be the climber?

15
00:00:55,896 --> 00:00:57,237
Nibs: You're a fish.

16
00:00:57,137 --> 00:00:58,932
Bubbles: A climbing fish!

17
00:00:59,133 --> 00:01:01,027
Mochi: Can I be the sleeper?

18
00:01:01,228 --> 00:01:03,722
Nibs: Everybody ready? Mission time!

19
00:01:06,522 --> 00:01:09,251
Everyone: Sneak, sneak, quiet feet!

20
00:01:09,350 --> 00:01:12,201
Everyone: We're the Snack Squad, can't be beat!

21
00:01:12,600 --> 00:01:15,262
Everyone: Tip, tip, tiptoe slow!

22
00:01:15,361 --> 00:01:17,822
Everyone: Off to the cookie, here we go!

23
00:01:22,421 --> 00:01:24,993
Nibs: Careful. Tiptoe. Tiptoe.

24
00:01:25,192 --> 00:01:28,073
Nibs: Whoa, whoa, whoaaa!

25
00:01:38,173 --> 00:01:41,228
Bubbles: Wheeeee! Look at me!

26
00:01:52,328 --> 00:01:54,487
Nibs: Step one. Complete.

27
00:01:56,188 --> 00:01:58,375
Bubbles: Again! Again!

28
00:01:58,775 --> 00:02:00,455
Nibs: No again!

29
00:02:03,055 --> 00:02:07,191
Nibs: Stop! Don't touch the moonbeams. They're super secret lasers!

30
00:02:07,590 --> 00:02:10,711
Nibs: Can you help us count the moonbeams? Ready?

31
00:02:11,311 --> 00:02:12,420
Everyone: One!

32
00:02:12,919 --> 00:02:14,014
Everyone: Two!

33
00:02:14,514 --> 00:02:15,903
Everyone: Three!

34
00:02:16,403 --> 00:02:17,516
Everyone: Four!

35
00:02:18,016 --> 00:02:19,174
Everyone: Five!

36
00:02:19,574 --> 00:02:22,048
Nibs: Five moonbeams! Thank you, friend!

37
00:02:28,147 --> 00:02:30,361
Bubbles: Limbo, limbo, blub!

38
00:02:41,961 --> 00:02:44,061
Mochi: Ooh. Warm.

39
00:02:45,161 --> 00:02:48,430
Nibs: Mochi, no napping! Push, Bubbles, push!

40
00:02:48,430 --> 00:02:51,432
Bubbles: Pushing! Wait, what are we pushing?

41
00:02:58,532 --> 00:03:00,009
Bubbles: What's that noise?

42
00:03:00,109 --> 00:03:02,447
Nibs: The robot vacuum! It's awake!

43
00:03:03,646 --> 00:03:07,111
Bubbles: It wants to eat us! Roll, roll, roll!

44
00:03:07,711 --> 00:03:10,628
Nibs: Which way should we go? Left? Or right?

45
00:03:13,228 --> 00:03:15,045
Nibs: Right! Good thinking!

46
00:03:28,145 --> 00:03:29,752
Nibs: Mochi, run!

47
00:03:29,951 --> 00:03:31,161
Mochi: I'm running!

48
00:03:48,760 --> 00:03:51,081
Nibs: Phew. That was close.

49
00:03:55,881 --> 00:03:58,019
Nibs: Step three. The tower!

50
00:03:58,218 --> 00:04:04,519
Nibs: Mochi at the bottom, because she's the biggest. Bubbles in the middle. And me on the top, because I'm the smallest!

51
00:04:04,618 --> 00:04:07,212
Bubbles: Biggest, middle, smallest!

52
00:04:13,312 --> 00:04:14,592
Mochi: Mmmf.

53
00:04:22,692 --> 00:04:24,713
Bubbles: Blub! Splishy!

54
00:04:34,814 --> 00:04:37,115
Nibs: Almost. Almost.

55
00:04:47,716 --> 00:04:49,582
Nibs: We. Did it.

56
00:04:53,983 --> 00:04:56,010
Bubbles: Look how big it is!

57
00:05:00,610 --> 00:05:03,726
Mochi: Ah. Ahh. ACHOO!

58
00:05:11,826 --> 00:05:12,997
Mochi: Oops.

59
00:05:13,398 --> 00:05:14,689
Bubbles: The cookie.

60
00:05:15,089 --> 00:05:17,394
Nibs: I planned. Everything.

61
00:05:20,194 --> 00:05:23,202
Mochi: I'm sorry. It just. Fell in.

62
00:05:28,002 --> 00:05:29,709
Lily: What's all this noise?

63
00:05:30,310 --> 00:05:31,883
Lily: Were you three hungry?

64
00:05:33,684 --> 00:05:37,259
Lily: Silly friends! You could have just asked me!

65
00:05:37,860 --> 00:05:43,078
Lily: Sunflower seeds for Nibs. Fish flakes for Bubbles. And a fishy biscuit for Mochi.

66
00:05:47,178 --> 00:05:49,566
Lily: Sharing is better than sneaking.

67
00:05:50,166 --> 00:05:52,758
Lily: And when you want something, what do you say?

68
00:05:53,358 --> 00:05:54,650
Everyone: Please!

69
00:05:55,250 --> 00:05:57,447
Lily: And when someone shares with you?

70
00:05:58,048 --> 00:05:59,359
Everyone: Thank you!

71
00:06:02,459 --> 00:06:04,853
Nibs: Next time, we just ask!

72
00:06:05,053 --> 00:06:06,316
Bubbles: Ask what?

73
00:06:10,916 --> 00:06:13,476
Everyone: Snack Squad! Snack Squad!

74
00:06:13,877 --> 00:06:17,724
Everyone: We ask, we share, we're the best team ever!

75
00:06:37,324 --> 00:06:39,926
Everyone: Bye bye, friends! See you next time!

